WEBVTT

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.970
"Bus Station"
"Dotonbori District 2"

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.890
<i>Shinkansen</i>, eh? I'm totally pumped!

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.270
O <i>Shinkansen</i>! O <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:23.310
--<i>Kanto. Hikari. Kodama. Nozomi. Mizuho. Hayate</i>!
--Sounds like a dicey job to me.
The reward better be worth it.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:28.850
The <i>Shinkansen </i>is sacred to people
from Kansai. I'm interested.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:33.270
A flower of red in full bloom...
It's beautiful...

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.390
Uh, um...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.560
You're being serious? That's what we're doing?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.220
That wasn't... a joke, right?

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:06.680
"Akudama Drive"

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.220
"2 hours earlier"

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:28.220
"Kansai Police Station"
"Execution Hall"

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:29.970
"Kansai Police Station"
"Execution Hall"
It looks like everyone's here.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:30.430
It looks like everyone's here.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.720
I'm glad you all made it.
That's veteran Akudama for you.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.220
Ooh, ventriloquism! Is that a Swindler trick?!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.680
It's not me! The cat's talking on its own!

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.310
I heard distortion in its voice.
From a speaker? Is it a robot?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.270
Robot?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.430
Don't be stupid! It's obviously a cat!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:53.100
No, "robot" was correct.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.680
I frickin' knew it!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:59.430
Well, this robotic cat here
talks like it's in charge.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.520
Are you the mastermind?

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.140
You could say that.

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:07.970
Up until you got collar bombs
was phase one of the plan.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.560
If you're in charge, could you
take my collar off maybe?

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.560
I kinda want to live, so...!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.270
Aww! I just put it on you!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.430
Take mine off, too--

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:22.430
I can't do that. You two were
never part of the plan, but...

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:26.850
...the fact that you're here
is proof of your abilities.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.600
I'll have you come along.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.720
Have us...

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:30.850
...come along?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.310
I said this was phase one, right?

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:39.140
No thanks. My job here is done.
And I don't work with shitheads.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:44.100
Who you calling shithead?! I work alone, too!
I'll rip this collar off and whoop your--

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.890
Just listen to what I have to say.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:52.890
As far as I'm concerned,
those collars are just reassurance for me.

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:57.770
You've been rewarded for rescuing Cutthroat.
Check your balances.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:00.720
"Crude Bank"
"Transfer from Black Cat successful"

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.680
"Crude Bank"
"Transfer from Black Cat successful"
I got paid or something.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.720
It's really 100 million...

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.810
100 mil? O-Oh yeah! Mr. Black Cat!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.850
--Shouldn't just one of us get it?
--Gimme some, too!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.220
I'm not concerned about who did the best.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:17.390
My only goal was to confirm
everyone's potential.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.770
Sounds awfully like a test. How'd we do?

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:25.100
Passed with flying colors.
The money is proof that you're hired.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:29.430
You mentioned "phase one."
I take it there's a phase two, then?

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:35.180
You'd better believe it. No Akudama
has ever completed phase two.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:39.100
Hey, hey, seriously?! Tell me more! What is it?!

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.680
Do I get to make more red flowers?

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.930
Hell yeah! 100 mil with my name on it!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.180
What's the objective?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.140
Attacking the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:52.100
Huh? What'd you say?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:55.350
D-Did I hear "<i>Shinkansen</i>"?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:59.520
You heard correctly. I want you
to attack the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.560
Attack the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:06.020
Now that's something I ain't done before!
It's gonna be awesome!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:10.100
It's the sole passage to Kanto,
not to mention a sacred entity.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.470
Th-That's right! Not the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:19.310
Anything but that! People worship it!
It's rule number one! We'll be cursed!

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:23.640
The <i>Shinkansen </i>sure is pretty.
It shines just like a knife.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.060
Isn't this one a little risky?

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:30.770
The <i>Shinkansen </i>is man-made.
It's nothing supernatural.

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.970
How much?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.520
How much for this job?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.640
A billion.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.270
B-Billion?!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.640
How do we know you'll pay that much?

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.720
I will. After all, I'm no swindler.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.890
Wha--?!

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.810
I heard voices coming from the middle!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:49.430
--Open it! Open it!
--Call for backup!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.520
--Sounds like we have company.
--Open it! Open it!
--Call for backup!

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:54.930
Let's relocate. I'll explain the rest there.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.680
I've just gotta go with the flow...

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:05.930
Hey! There's so many buses!
Why ain't one coming?!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:09.470
Well, nobody wants to come to a place like this.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:14.560
This <i>should </i>be the fastest way to
the abandoned factory I had in mind.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:19.600
We need to get our hands on a bus,
huh? Easy enough for me!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.520
Huh?!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.140
Yo!

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:34.220
Woo! That was totally sick!
He's frickin' nuts! Holy shit!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.140
Hey! How do I steer this thing?!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:38.930
How dumb.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.020
Shithead.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.810
That dumb shit!

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:45.560
I've never played with
a bus before. Might be fun.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:53.810
Hey, look! I think I'm driving it!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:54.560
Shithead.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:55.600
Bird brain.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.850
That shitbrain!

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:12.060
"Kansai Airlane"
"Flying Bus Interior"

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.100
So high! We're flying!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:17.180
What a primitive system. How boring.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:21.310
That jump was pretty slick!
You're a total monster!

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:22.720
Eh?!

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:26.770
Right?! 'Cuz I'm the world's best brawler!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.640
Yes! He's simple!

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.770
So what are you awesome at?

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:31.430
Huh?

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.770
You must've been in prison for something.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:39.930
Uh... hell yeah! They don't put you
in the bottom level for nothing!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:44.180
I was down there serving 500,000,000 years!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:48.890
500,000,000?! You must be super
strong, Bro! What'd you do?!

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:56.470
W-Well I can't say, but I did stuff just
as bad as attacking the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:07:56.470 --> 00:08:01.970
Hey, hey! He's the real deal!
Hear that, guys? He's awesome!

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:10.100
W-Wow! 500,000,000 years!

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.310
Right?!

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:15.100
You're so kind, Ms. Swindler!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.220
Red lights! So pretty!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:22.310
Hey, can I bum a smoke?

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:25.640
If you give me one, I'll let you have a go.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.350
Nope.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.770
Huh? Are you gay?

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.220
"Push button"
"Push for next stop"
"Next stop - North Shinchi"
"Thank you for riding today!"

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:36.810
Red! Red! Red! Red! Red...!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.100
"Push"
"Push for Emergency"
Red! Red! Red! Red! Red...!

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.890
That's for emergencies!

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.220
It's all red!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:46.220
"Emergency Alert"
Emergency! Emergency! Engine full throttle!
Afterburners engaged!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.470
Emergency! Emergency! Engine full throttle!
Afterburners engaged!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:09:00.060
Red! Red! Red! Red! Red...!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.180
Where's the bus taking us?!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.220
What?!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:08.020
Next stop is Seven Star Hotel. Seven Star Hotel.

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.390
"Seven Star Hotel"
"Geisha de Maiko"
Next stop is Seven Star Hotel. Seven Star Hotel.

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:15.060
Stay at Geisha de Maiko for
a pleasant and relaxing trip.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.770
Hello! Bunny here!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.680
'Sup? It's Shark here!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:40.970
This is an educational program
that teaches the history of Kansai!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:44.520
Every day, it airs 23 times!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.680
Shark, hey Shark! You know about Kanto?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:53.970
Kanto's a utopia to the East where
the gods and important people live!

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:56.930
Uh-huh! Then, how about Kansai?

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:00.310
Kansai is where we're living right now!

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:02.810
And each ward is special!

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:04.270
Tell me more!

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:07.100
The South is packed full of criminals!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.770
The Central is where most
of the middle class lives!

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.680
The North is where rich people live,

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:17.680
so that's where the fancy
houses and businesses are!

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:21.310
Yeah, yeah! I wish I could live up North!

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:26.810
But because of a war long ago,
Kansai was burned to the ground!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:30.220
Kanto dropped a new type of bomb on it!

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:33.600
After losing the war, Kansai nearly collapsed!

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:39.470
But believe it or not, it was Kanto
that reached out a helping hand!

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:46.220
Once Kansai was rebuilt, the people were
forever grateful and began to revere Kanto!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:51.680
We're so thankful! As long as Kanto
guides us, everything will be fine!

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:53.850
Well, until next time!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.680
"The End"
"Produced by
Kansai"

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:02.430
"Seven Star Hotel"
"Geisha de Maiko Floor 42"

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.930
I'm dead. I'm so dead.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.770
Get off me!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:11.930
That's the world's best brawler for you!
A bus crash doesn't faze you!

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:17.060
Of course not, Bro!
My body's stronger than steel!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.850
You okay?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:24.850
Uh, thank you. Um...

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:26.850
I'm Cutthroat.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.100
Um, Mr. Cutthroat...

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:34.560
You know, pink isn't half bad. It's what
you get mixing red and white, right?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.720
--Huh?
--Still, pink just isn't that vivid.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:38.270
--Still, pink just isn't that vivid.

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:42.140
Uh, um... Mr. Cutthroat?

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:43.100
Beautiful...

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:46.720
Huh? What?! I-I'm not... I'm normal!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:50.640
You're mine now! I won't
let anyone else have you!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.430
Huh?! U-Uh...!

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.720
B-But I don't know anything about you!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:58.390
--Um, I'm just not ready for that sort of thing!

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:01.310
--Not bad for an abandoned factory.
--Um, I'm just not ready for that sort of thing!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:05.720
This isn't the right place,
but I guess it makes no difference.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:09.720
What a positive-thinking cat.
Or it simply doesn't care.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:13.720
I found a suite room! I'm claiming this one!

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:17.140
In that case, I'm taking the royal suite room!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:20.600
Royal?! That's my bro for you!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:26.140
Surrender! Surrender!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.060
What's this? Room service already?

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.810
Think you could go clean 'em up?

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.850
"Off Limits"

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:48.350
Inspector, our guys keep getting
wiped out. If this keeps up--

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:50.220
I can see that!

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:54.680
"HQ Radio"
This is HQ. Two Executioners are
on their way. Estimated arrival is...

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:58.350
Executioners, huh? We didn't ask for help.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.970
"Seven Star Hotel"
"Suite Room"

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.720
Ooh, blood!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.140
Wh-What the heck was that for?! Huh?!

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:16.390
Leave it too long and your skin won't be pretty.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:20.770
I don't wanna be pretty enough to lick!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.470
Now we can finally sit down and talk.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:27.970
It's time to tell us.
What job is worth one billion?

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:30.680
Well then, I guess I should explain.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:37.060
As you know, the <i>Shinkansen </i>is the
sole passage joining Kansai and Kanto.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:42.520
Goods from the Kyushu Plant are
transported to Kanto via Kansai Station.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.310
Kyushu Plant?

00:13:44.310 --> 00:13:47.810
Oh... You haven't heard of Kyushu Plant?

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.310
It's a research city run by Kanto.

00:13:50.310 --> 00:13:54.680
All the world's Kanto products
are fabricated there.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:58.270
For example, Courier's bike.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.390
Your job is to steal cargo on the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:03.770
What, specifically?

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.350
A 1.5-meter vault in the front carriage.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.180
"Solid"    "Secure"
A 1.5-meter vault in the front carriage.

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.100
"Solid"    "Secure"
