00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.890
What's inside it?

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:13.220
You don't need to know.
The contents are irrelevant to the plan.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.220
Hmm?

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:18.140
Needless to say, Kansai Station is one
of the most heavily guarded places.

