It's up there with the Kansai
Central Information Bureau.

00:14:23.640 --> 00:14:25.810
Aka, the Seal Center.

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.430
The Seal Center?

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:30.640
It controls all the information in Kansai!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.890
I'm there all the time!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:37.060
That's Swindler for you.
Not even I could get in.

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:41.600
Huh? Uh, yeah! It's actually kinda easy for me!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.270
I don't care how many guards there are.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.060
I'll crush 'em all and plunder away.

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:51.560
The <i>Shinkansen </i>stops at Kansai
Station for just 20 minutes.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:54.720
I picked all of you as my team for a reason.

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:59.140
Screw that. Gimme 20 minutes
and I'll do it myself.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.970
How long's 20 minutes?

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:03.890
Shorter than you think.

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:09.430
In other words, all our abilities are
needed to infiltrate and steal it.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:16.270
That's right. Kansai Station is impenetrable.
There're countless defenses inside.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:16.720
Even if you reach the platform,
the <i>Shinkansen </i>has no doors or windows.

