Wh-What's that?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:05.640
It's a scar from the bomb dropped in the war.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:11.720
It's a dome-like zone some hundred
kilometers wide that's practically hell.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:15.810
The air's contaminated and
there's nonstop wind and lightning.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:19.140
It's why the <i>Shinkansen</i>
is the only way to Kanto.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.180
There's security within the train, too.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.720
It's impervious, inside and out.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.600
There's also the time limit.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:30.810
So? Doesn't it sound like a job worth a billion?

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:34.520
Indeed. Succeed and we'll be famous forever.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.970
Where do I deliver the cargo?

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:41.060
I'll reveal that once the cargo is obtained.

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:45.140
I'm pumped up! This is gonna
be the best fight ever!

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:50.310
Y-Yeah! My sentence is gonna
be like 10 billion years!

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:52.310
If you're in, I am, too.

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:53.770
M-Me?!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:56.100
I'm glad you're all interested.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:17:01.100
If someone wanted to drop out,
I was ready to blow off their head.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.100
Kansai Execution Department.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:14.720
"Kansai Police"

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.140
"Kansai Police"
In accordance with the law, I will execute you!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:16.020
"Kansai Police"
"License to Kill"
In accordance with the law, I will execute you!

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:18.100
In accordance with the law, I will execute you!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.560
"Conviction"

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.180
"Full Effort"

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.560
"Execute"

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.220
"Master"       "Pupil"

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:32.430
"License to Kill"

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:33.270
"License to Kill"
Now then, it's time to clean up.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:35.520
Now then, it's time to clean up.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:48.020
Execute?!

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:53.600
Yikes! They specialize in killing Akudama!
It's over! My life is over!

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.890
I'd rather not get caught up
in this and die. Bye.

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.100
Let's meet later.

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.600
Take me with you!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:04.310
Hurry and take out the trash.

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.060
Yes, right away!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.060
I want your red eyes!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:08.810
Idiot!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.520
Hey! Stay outta my way, Cutthroat!

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:15.970
--My precious knife!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.640
--What a creepy fellow.
--My precious knife!

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:19.930
You shit!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:29.180
"Deep Blue"

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.430
Tsk! I don't have time to waste on you!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:47.520
Hey, hey! You think that
little stick can stop my fist?!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.680
Your fist is nothing to me!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:53.180
Now you've gone and said it!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:06.180
One down.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:07.930
"Crimson"

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:08.640
"Canceled"

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:11.180
"Canceled"
Such atrocious mood lighting.

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:16.640
"Criminal Record - Theft, Blackmail"
"Sentence - 4 Years"

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.020
"Criminal Record - Theft, Blackmail"
"Sentence - 4 Years"
Only a four-year sentence?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:25.180
He's just a hoodlum.

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.770
Run, Mr. Hoodlum!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.770
Huh? I'm Hoodlum?

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:30.470
What? She's not even Akudama?

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.720
"Criminal Record - None"
"Sentence - 0 Years"
What? She's not even Akudama?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:38.140
Fool! Don't you know who this is?!
Three hundred trillion yen in damages!

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:42.890
More than the national budget!
It's the legendary Swindler!

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:45.560
What?! Did you tamper with our database?!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.850
That's a piece of cake for her!

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.430
--You're dead! You're so dead!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.600
--Can you please run?!
--You're dead! You're so dead!

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.640
This is the end. Die for your sins.

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:01.810
If that was on purpose, you're good.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.560
Come over here and fight me!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.520
Do your job, damn Pupil.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:06.970
You got time to talk?!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.520
All the time in the world.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.970
You're strong, yes... But that's all you are.

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.680
What?!

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:21.520
I've got a present for you.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:22.770
"Automatic Start"
Enjoy.

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:48.270
Not too shabby.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:51.890
I'm terribly... sorry.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.100
We'll get 'em next time.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:59.640
"Kansai"
"Abandoned Factory"

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:05.350
I'm alive... I'm really alive...

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:09.720
I'm glad to see that nobody died.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:10.640
Indeed.

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:13.060
Whoa! How the hell are you alive?!

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.770
I'm Doctor. I can self-medicate.

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.310
Executioners, huh?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.220
Huh? I can really kill everyone?

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:26.020
They're pretty damn good! I'm pumped!
I'll whoop their asses next time!

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:28.770
Yeah! I know you can do it!

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.020
What should I do?

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:34.720
The Execution Department
sure came down on us quick.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:38.680
I have no choice but to account
for them in the plan now.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:41.520
Would you like a part to play, Swindler?

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:46.890
Huh? I think it's safer for everyone
if I sit on the sidelines!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:53.640
Good grief. I can already tell
this job will be trouble.

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:46.970
It feels like I've strayed so far...
